descriere:
Nivel de vechime: Asociat
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Fabricația de autovehicule
We are looking for an IT Business Analyst specialized in Data Management area , to design, build, and support modern data solutions across data engineering, data warehousing, business intelligence, and AI-enabled analytics.
 Main responsibilities: 
 The role will work primarily with Databricks, covering the data lifecycle from ingestion and transformation through governed data products, analytical models, reporting, and conversational analytics such as Databricks Genie.
 The position is aimed as a hands-on mid-level technical role. Project coordination and stakeholder interaction are part of the position, but the primary focus remains solution development, data engineering, data modeling and operational support.
 Qualifications: 
 Direct Databricks experience is highly desirable. However, we also welcome candidates with strong experience in transferable technologies such as SQL, Python, Microsoft Azure or other cloud data platforms, ETL/ELT, data warehousing and BI, combined with the motivation and technical foundation to develop further on Databricks.
 Relevant hands-on experience in one or more of the following areas:
Data engineering;
Data platform development;
ETL/ELT development, practical experience designing, developing or maintaining data pipelines; working knowledge of Python, PySpark or another relevant scripting/programming language used for data processing;
Experience with data warehousing and analytical data modeling;
Analytics engineering;
BI solution development with substantial involvement in the underlying data layer;
Experience using Git or another version-control system.
 Contract period: 1 Year 
 *Only selected applicants will be contacted for further steps in the recruiting process.
